   "strokeColor": "#FAFAFA",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "rows 7 \u2013 22   \u2014   THE BODY   \u00b7   74 \u00d7 16\nrow  7      pinned summary      247 games  \u25cb 198  \u25d0 12  \u25c9 6  \u2298 31    \u2190 R-10(c), outside the scroll\nrow  8      (respiro)\nrow  9      column header       STATE           TITLE                  HRS\nrows 10\u201321  THE SCROLL REGION   12 game rows at this size\nrow 22      scroll position     4\u201315 of 247",
